# Docker build context exclusions (P1-05, extended by P1-11, ADR-029).
# Required: secrets and local-only files must never reach an image layer.
# Reused by P1-11's compose builds and the Render Docker services.
#
# Docker matches a bare pattern (e.g. `.env`) only at the context root, and
# the Dockerfiles `COPY apps ./apps`, so nested files such as apps/api/.env
# (read by the API settings) or apps/web/.env.local would otherwise reach the
# image. Secret and artifact patterns therefore use `**/` (any depth).

# Secrets and local configuration — never bake into images
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/secrets/
**/credentials.json
**/.armoriq/

# Local-only progress journals (untracked scratch files)
LOCAL_PROGRESS.md

# Python / Node artifacts (reinstalled inside the image)
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
**/node_modules/
apps/web/dist/

# Supporting research / decision reports (never shipped)
research/
FlowState-ArmorIQ-Decision-Report.md

# VCS, editors, OS
.git/
.gitignore
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Caches, logs, local data
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
**/*.log
logs/
.fastembed_cache/
.cache/
coverage/
htmlcov/
